          <attvalue for="statement" value="Nash's Historical Sketch of Weymouth (1885), Appendix C, records East Field (p. 258) and Mill Field (p. 278) parcels &quot;first granted to John Gurny/Gurnie&quot; but already held by other men by the 1643 partial property record." />
