          <attvalue for="research_unit_title" value="Colonial Braintree community" />
          <attvalue for="statement" value="John Gurney held recognised standing in the Braintree community — signing the 1645 plantation petition, serving as probate witness and inventory-taker for Gregory Baxter (1659), and appearing across a dense Braintree creditor network in his own 1663 estate accounts." />
